<title>SWEDEN: Swedish debt office says no change to C.Bank areas.</title>
<headline>Swedish debt office says no change to C.Bank areas.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, should remain responsible for monetary and foreign exchange policy, the country's national debt office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The debt office statement was made in response to a suggestion that this responsibility be altered.</p>
</text>
